From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: TheKit <thekit@disroot.org>
Date: Mon, 3 Aug 2026 10:40:10 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] surfaceflinger: Post task streams to the hwcomposer

Each task renders into a 2-slot buffer pool and is posted over
vendor.waydroid.display@1.3. Slot busy-ness follows the HAL's
wl_buffer.release reports; when both slots are held the frame is
skipped and the compositor keeps the last posted buffer.

Change-Id: I7496046d05500ff604dc72d5969dc71e1e3645ba
